{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_town002_kanban_01",
      "hash": "7637aec9d1a1b94f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這裡是常青市\\n常青即是亙古恆久的翠綠之色"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_town002_kanban_02",
      "hash": "7637afc9d1a1bb02",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "常青市寶可夢道館"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_town002_door_01",
      "hash": "b7246880b3c9c456",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "常青市道館的門\\n鎖上了……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_town002_kanban_03",
      "hash": "7637b0c9d1a1bcb5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 3]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_town002_kanban_04",
      "hash": "7637a9c9d1a1b0d0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……有用的告示板！\\c\\n當精靈球用完了，\\n就到友好商店購買吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_town002_kanban_05",
      "hash": "7637aac9d1a1b283",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這裡是訓練家學校\\n知識就是力量！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_town002_childm_01_01",
      "hash": "514de6fb5176410d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳帶著的……！\\n正是寶可夢！\\c\\n能和喜歡的寶可夢\\n一起到處走動，\\r\\n這個世界真美好啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_town002_oldm_01_01",
      "hash": "75c5dea9e5248190",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "無論什麼時候來，\\n這間道館的門總是鎖著的。\\c\\n到底這裡的館主\\n是個怎樣的傢伙啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_town002_oldm_01_02",
      "hash": "75c5e1a9e52486a9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "常青市的\\n道館館主回來了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_town002_bugcatcher_01_01",
      "hash": "064dd86c3fe6a1d6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一定不知道\\n蟲寶寶寶可夢有２種吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_town002_bugcatcher_01_02",
      "hash": "064dd76c3fe6a023",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那就好！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_town002_bugcatcher_01_03",
      "hash": "064dd66c3fe69e70",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "綠毛蟲沒有毒，\\n可是獨角蟲是有毒的。\\c\\n要小心不要被牠\\n扎到[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_town002_jevenile_f_01",
      "hash": "52931ec5d1be27bf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 12]"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_town002_poke_01",
      "hash": "1102f61156ce1dad",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "走路草「走路～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_town002_middlem_01",
      "hash": "01f9b8b8687961de",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呦！[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳好啊，真新人！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_town002_max",
      "hash": "10b6dd555c3b853a"
    }
  ]
}
